        "credit": "Illustration based on the Gousto recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "step-3",
      "number": 3,
      "heading": "Fry the chicken",
      "blocks": [
        "Boil a full kettle. Heat vegetable oil in a wide frying pan on high. Cook the chicken for 3 minutes on each side, until golden. Use two pans for extra chicken."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [
        {
          "id": "timer-1",
          "label": "Fry the chicken",
          "seconds": [
            180
          ]
        }
      ],
